 profile | About VALTRIX            |         | [{"heading": "About VALTRIX", "paragraphs": ["VALTRIX is a precision manufacturer of ultra-high-purity fluid control components for semiconductor, biopharmaceutical, LED/display, solar and hydrogen energy industries. Our product range covers VCR face seal fittings, welded fittings, diaphragm valves, pressure reducers, check valves and gas filters — all manufactured from 316L stainless steel with electro-polished surface options.", "Every component is produced with full material traceability, assembled in an ISO Class 4/5 cleanroom, and 100% helium leak tested before double-bagged packaging. This discipline, rooted in years of OEM manufacturing experience, is what allows VALTRIX components to meet the contamination-control demands of advanced semiconductor fabs.", "From a single fitting to complete gas panels, VALTRIX provides engineering support, custom manufacturing and fast, reliable delivery worldwide."]}]
 history | Milestones               |         | [{"heading": "Milestones", "paragraphs": ["VALTRIX grew from a precision machining workshop serving international OEM customers into a dedicated manufacturer of ultra-high-purity fluid control components.", "Through continuous investment in CNC machining, electro-polishing and cleanroom assembly, VALTRIX now supplies VCR face seal fittings, diaphragm valves and regulators to semiconductor and high-purity process industries worldwide."]}]
 honors  | Quality & Certifications |         | [{"heading": "Quality & Certifications", "paragraphs": ["VALTRIX operates an ISO 9001 certified quality management system covering design, machining, assembly, testing and delivery of high-purity fluid control components.", "Each production lot is 100% helium mass spectrometer leak tested (sensitivity to 1x10-10 scc/s), with surface roughness measurement and particle control at every stage. Materials carry full mill certificate traceability, and assemblies are packaged in ISO Class 4/5 cleanroom conditions."]}]
 contact | Contact Us               |         | [{"heading": "Contact Us", "paragraphs": ["For product inquiries, selection support, OEM/ODM projects or business cooperation, please contact the VALTRIX team anytime. We respond within one business day."]}]

